  "content": "<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160217295201783889/file.png?ex=6533db8e&amp;is=6521668e&amp;hm=420769f1fc6e28ed6c287e4fba9a9d3f16827a84158bec5d6402c091c44dab89&amp;=&amp;width=1440&amp;height=279\" alt=\"\" width=\"1033\" height=\"200\" /><br /><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160219242059280464/bone2.png?ex=6533dd5f&amp;is=6521685f&amp;hm=f8b1f9915d91be6ac006b3f180031fc9c655af6d38ee536172ad0baa4dfc00e4&amp;=\" alt=\"\" width=\"857\" height=\"80\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160217296233582632/about.png?ex=6533db8f&amp;is=6521668f&amp;hm=06ab023e3d0033769445ef4fb89d9bdaa19c9394aec391962cabfd6c5df83db8&amp;=\" alt=\"\" width=\"345\" height=\"58\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">《食人族謎團》是一款新增致命食人族、粗獷村落與食人生活方式的模組！</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 36px;\"><strong>本模組包含：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">5 種新物品</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2 種實用方塊</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">2 種危險生物</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">以及全新結構！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160217296569118760/features.png?ex=6533db8f&amp;is=6521668f&amp;hm=5ad91cbfa69b3dc01fd91aef6267bf55849c575118b53f0cdc7319ea361cf10b&amp;=\" alt=\"\" width=\"464\" height=\"53\" /></p>\n\n<details>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\"><strong>生物：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">食人族</span> - 在自然生成的食人族村落中出現的新敵對人類生物。他們手持骨劍相當強悍，且移動迅速。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160720628257656873/333.png?ex=6535b052&amp;is=65233b52&amp;hm=c2b8268ef1a2ebfd2bdfad216df2e50046286f82756f112bb25f1b2a7324bdbf&amp;=&amp;width=820&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"424\" height=\"350\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">食人族屠夫</span> - 同樣出現在食人族村落的龐大食人族類型。食人族屠夫是「迷你頭目」，會用其扭曲打造的怪物武器「石鋸」與玩家展開激烈戰鬥。石鋸是能撕裂血肉與骨骼的極強武器。擊敗食人族屠夫的勇敢玩家將獲得石鋸作為獎勵。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160720628580622416/444.png?ex=6535b053&amp;is=65233b53&amp;hm=7fc1dc19f05a931784635cb518539e72958e5f767d553b51e9233e000f341e61&amp;=&amp;width=662&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"408\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\"><strong>物品與消耗品：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">骨劍</span> - 食人族與玩家皆可使用的奇特新工具。骨劍是相當強力但耐久度極低的新武器。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">骨製面具</span> - 玩家可獲得的特殊面具。骨製面具是防禦力薄弱的面具，但具有獨特效果：配戴時所有骷髏類生物將對你保持友善。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">石鋸</span> - 擊退食人族屠夫的玩家專屬獎勵。石鋸是玩家可用來撕裂生物的極強工具。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">新鮮人肉</span> - 替代腐肉的新消耗品。新鮮人肉是可回復適度飽食度的食物，但會使玩家渴望食用更多人肉。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">人肉辣醬</span> - 美味的佳餚。人肉辣醬是能回復大量飽食度的全新碗裝食物，但仍會使玩家渴望更多人肉。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 36px;\"><strong>方塊：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">頭骨燈</span> - 新的光源方塊。頭骨燈是照亮環境的病態方式。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">骨製陷阱</span> - 對方塊的創新設計。骨製陷阱是由骨骼製成的粗糙陷阱，會刺傷任何膽敢踩踏的實體。</span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size: 36px;\">結構：</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 24px;\">食人族村落</span> - 食人族的扭曲聚集地，藏有豐厚獎勵，但居民並不友善。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1166487536965783643/2023-10-24_17.21.06_-_Copy.png?ex=654aab2d&amp;is=6538362d&amp;hm=05325e14265a977522ed8bbf63297c3fc8341daf6eb0e9a0df2a797f7d0b758b&amp;=&amp;width=1202&amp;height=676\" alt=\"\" width=\"1113\" height=\"626\" /></span></p>\n\n</details>\n\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160219242059280464/bone2.png?ex=6533dd5f&amp;is=6521685f&amp;hm=f8b1f9915d91be6ac006b3f180031fc9c655af6d38ee536172ad0baa4dfc00e4&amp;=\" alt=\"\" width=\"857\" height=\"80\" /></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\"><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160217295960948836/geckolib.png?ex=6533db8f&amp;is=6521668f&amp;hm=034a9b4282235f07eca8d6e72329528d2dbbdc6118e95de9826983b3b6b94283&amp;=\" alt=\"\" width=\"558\" height=\"48\" /></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"https://spooky-jam.com/\"><img style=\"font-size: 18px;\" src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/907482116453982208/1160217295579262996/madefor.png?ex=6533db8f&amp;is=6521668f&amp;hm=f29417622d42255251c902ecb46961c64e563d2b696ffefc5c4f1f7304f4f2b6&amp;=\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"83\" /></a></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 14px;\">模組靈感源自《德州電鋸殺人狂》系列電影。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 8px;\"><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Hpot2qQpBtSOj3KatV341_SoODs2H_lG5zp34IC4Jlk/edit?usp=sharing\"><em>音效鳴謝</em></a></span></span></p>\n<div id=\"gtx-trans\" style=\"position: absolute; left: 1px; top: 3284.12px;\">&nbsp;</div>",
